      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "message",
      "stage": "dccp_fsm",
      "description": "The Ack Vectors should be split at points corresponding to previous acknowledgements, since the stored ack_nonce fields provide enough information to calculate correct Nonce Echoes.",
